{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>He will call Me</b> — And at the time he calls Me by My name, and when trouble comes upon the people of his generation according to My decrees, I will be with My servant." "<b>And I will rescue him and I will exalt him</b> — So that he will not need anyone but Me."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 91, :notes {0 "The word גזירותי ('My decrees') is read literally; Ibn Ezra appears to mean the troubles decreed upon his generation."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:57.658611967Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}